{"acceptance_length": 7.456521739130435, "acceptance_lengths": [5, 3, 2, 8, 13, 7, 4, 6, 6, 3, 10, 1, 3, 6, 4, 4, 2, 2, 5, 6, 10, 6, 12, 2, 16, 4, 8, 2, 1, 16, 13, 5, 16, 16, 16, 16, 14, 4, 1, 9, 16, 2, 8, 14, 2, 14], "accepted_draft_lengths": [4, 2, 1, 7, 12, 6, 3, 5, 5, 2, 9, 0, 2, 5, 3, 3, 1, 1, 4, 5, 9, 5, 11, 1, 15, 3, 7, 1, 0, 15, 12, 4, 15, 15, 15, 15, 13, 3, 0, 8, 15, 1, 7, 13, 1, 13], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 32132079616, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 32132062208, "benchmark": "gsm8k", "completion": "We are given the following information:\n\n- The school auditorium has **4 rows** of seats.\n- Each row has **18 seats**.\n- **One-fourth** of the seats were occupied by **administrators**.\n- **One-third** of the **remaining** seats were occupied by **parents**.\n- The **rest** were occupied by **students**.\n\nWe are to find **how many students** were in the auditorium.\n\n---\n\n### **Step 1: Total number of seats**\n\n$$\n\\text{Total seats} = 4 \\text{ rows} \\times 18 \\text{ seats per row} = 72 \\text{ seats}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 2: Seats occupied by administrators**\n\n$$\n\\text{Admin seats} = \\frac{1}{4} \\times 72 = 18 \\text{ seats}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 3: Remaining seats after administrators**\n\n$$\n\\text{Remaining seats} = 72 - 18 = 54 \\text{ seats}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 4: Seats occupied by parents**\n\n$$\n\\text{Parent seats} = \\frac{1}{3} \\times 54 = 18 \\text{ seats}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 5: Seats occupied by students**\n\n$$\n\\text{Student seats} = 54 - 18 = 36 \\text{ seats}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 **Final Answer:**\n\n$$\n\\boxed{36}\n$$\n\nThere were **36 students** in the school auditorium.", "decode_seconds": 2.4589401483535767, "draft_calls": 46, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 91, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "93a8f833aa19ee607acb3e9174ea07c72de1583f6267a0a23075cf7c4c43320d", "method": "relay_factorized4096_n2048", "output_hash": "dbdcf3bc673b8446a1a972d0344b50021af398139b7f7f996515e6ec0966aa04